      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-04-01T10:05:45.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>To clarify slightly, skipping your turn means you skip your <span class=\"bbcode-i\">whole</span> turn. That is, every phase including the rest of your Start phase (if there was anything left that was due to occur during said phase) and all of your End phase. If something tells you to <span class=\"bbcode-i\">end</span> your turn, you skip everything up to the End phase, and then do anything that needs to be done there (if applicable).</p>",
